      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "A good draw should give GO WITHOUT (3) the chance to show his best form. He was held up from a wider barrier last week and there was merit in his prior effort for fourth. Owns a decent record at the mile and this suits. LETSSTARTINHEAVEN (9) missed narrowly two back at Goulburn then broke as favourite when fourth last time. Has been back to the trials since. With manners and some luck from out wide he could win this. MONTEFIORE NZ (2) has come from wider barriers when tackling some smart rivals of late. The better draw brings him into contention. GUILTY PARTY (4) drew wide rand worked but stuck on to place last start. Include along with CREDULOUS (10) who draws widest but has been racing well against the mares of late.",
